Subject: [PATCH] Mesg::GetField: model rewrite accepted by the search
 (generation 23)

Provenance: greedy search, seed 1, generation 23, region 234 (Mesg::GetField).
Generated by the model (deepseek-v4.1-flash); not hand-written. Search-time ratio R (candidate/stock, <1 is faster): 0.8856 -> 0.8826 at acceptance (max of two measurements). This is a ranking value, NOT an independent per-patch
confirmation; only the fixed FINAL patch of the run was re-measured independently.
Cumulative patch it was derived from: runs/deepseek/greedy-s1-1072019/patches/gen_23.patch (diff against stock; do not apply together with the others).
Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/fit_mesg.cpp | 21 ++++++++++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 18 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/fit_mesg.cpp b/src/fit_mesg.cpp
index 30fa22a..6baf0e7 100644
--- a/src/fit_mesg.cpp
+++ b/src/fit_mesg.cpp
@@ -250,10 +250,25 @@ Field* Mesg::GetFieldByIndex(const FIT_UINT16 index)
 
 Field* Mesg::GetField(const FIT_UINT8 fieldNum)
 {
-    for (int i = 0; i < (int)fields.size(); i++)
+    Field* field = fields.data();
+    auto count = fields.size();
+
+    while (count >= 4)
     {
-        if (fields[i].GetNum() == fieldNum)
-            return &fields[i];
+        if (field[0].GetNum() == fieldNum) return &field[0];
+        if (field[1].GetNum() == fieldNum) return &field[1];
+        if (field[2].GetNum() == fieldNum) return &field[2];
+        if (field[3].GetNum() == fieldNum) return &field[3];
+        field += 4;
+        count -= 4;
+    }
+
+    while (count != 0)
+    {
+        if (field->GetNum() == fieldNum)
+            return field;
+        ++field;
+        --count;
     }
 
     return FIT_NULL;
